<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>E-Certificate — <%= donation.certificateCode %></title><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#eef2f5;color:#18212b}.certificate{max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;background:#fff;border:10px solid #17212b;padding:70px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.12);text-align:center}.mark{font-size:42px}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.title{font-size:48px;margin:18px 0 8px}.name{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;margin:30px 0}.line{width:90px;border-top:2px solid #17212b;margin:24px auto}.meta{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:70px;margin:35px 0}.meta div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.meta span{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;opacity:.6}.meta b{font-size:18px}.code{margin-top:40px;font-size:12px;opacity:.6}.note{margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;opacity:.7}.print{display:block;margin:20px auto;text-align:center}@media print{body{background:#fff}.certificate{margin:0;box-shadow:none;max-width:none;min-height:100vh}.print{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class="certificate"><div class="mark"><img src="/images/pulsereach-logo.png" alt="PulseReach logo"></div><div class="eyebrow">PULSEREACH · DIGITAL CERTIFICATE</div><div class="title">Certificate of Appreciation</div><div class="line"></div><p>This certificate is presented to</p><div class="name"><%= donor.name %></div><p>in recognition of a recorded blood donation made through the PulseReach mobilisation platform.</p><div class="meta"><div><span>Date</span><b><%= new Date(donation.donationDate).toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{day:'2-digit',month:'long',year:'numeric'}) %></b></div><div><span>Location</span><b><%= donation.location %></b></div></div><div class="code">Certificate ID: <%= donation.certificateCode %></div><div class="note">This digital certificate records the donation event entered by the organiser. It is not a medical record or eligibility certificate.</div></div><button class="print" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button><script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script></body></html>
